      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yes please. I'm tired of video players breaking due to youtube-dl going out of date and then the dev team taking an absurdly long amount of time to update youtube-dl again. Sometimes it gets to the point where people aren't able to watch any youtube videos for weeks at a time. It also affects any club worlds that use youtube videos for music, effectively making those worlds useless for weeks.",
